OL,3,GNEWSAMissiles and fireworks 'thrown at
OL,4,Aemergency crews'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMissiles, fireworks and bricks have
OL,7,Fbeen thrown at emergency crews in
OL,8,F"planned violent disorder", police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FNorthumbria Police said crews had been
OL,12,Fsubjected to violent attacks after
OL,13,Fresponding to reports of anti-social
OL,14,Fbehaviour in the Waterville Road area
OL,15,Fof Meadow Well in North Tyneside at
OL,16,Fabout 21:00 GMT on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
