OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMissiles and fireworks 'thrown at
OL,4,Aemergency crews'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the disorder related to
OL,7,Fmisinformation surrounding the future
OL,8,Fof a building, which was wrongly
OL,9,Fbelieved to be a House of
OL,10,FMulti-occupancy (HMO). Police said a
OL,11,Fsupermarket was planned for the site.
OL,13,FOfficers said the behaviour was
OL,14,F"completely unacceptable" and it was
OL,15,Fsharing the information to stop
OL,16,Fspeculation which "may lead to further
OL,17,Fdisorder".
